{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-7-2:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_7_2\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_2-heading\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"7.2 治疗期\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_2-treatment-period\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"治疗期应自第1天首次给药开始，至第24周末次给药/主要终点评估结束；负荷给药期第1、8、15、22天每周一次共4次，维持给药期第36天起每两周一次至第24周。随机化应按1:1进行，并按中心分层；随机化时点应为第1天（基线/随机/首次给药），基线评估应在首次给药前完成；确认符合全部入排标准并完成随机化后，应在第1天开始首次给药。首次给药应按随机分配接受合成药X 150 mg/1.0 mL或生理盐水安慰剂1.0 mL皮下注射；给药前应核对随机号和药物标识，保持双盲。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_2-treatment-visits\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"各治疗访视应完成资格/随机核对、研究干预准备与给药、依从性记录、合并用药和背景治疗记录以及不良事件（AE）记录。安全性评估应按方案进行生命体征、临床安全性评估和不良事件监测。第24周应评估主要终点（NPS≤1且鼻塞VAS≤1的临床缓解）及次要终点（SNOT-22变化、Lund-Kennedy内镜评分变化）。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_2-blinding\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"盲态处理应遵循双盲，试验参与者、研究者和疗效评价者保持盲态；合成药X与安慰剂应同体积、同途径、同频率给药。揭盲仅应按紧急揭盲程序执行，并记录揭盲原因、日期和人员；揭盲后试验参与者应继续按计划随访，除非研究者判断需终止。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"876dd477bb88408030960a35a315b411102431400718444c4b56b67456de5187"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:be86734d4fdd5e2747b98878f73c89cd240df9ef4e765b3ed639b8fadc4315b6:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:be86734d4fdd5e2747b98878f73c89cd240df9ef4e765b3ed639b8fadc4315b6:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"b4bec93e302b1c30b8070b3bfac2b87510c13c5fe7d7e3a469ab2e08e30f7ff3","prompt_sha256":"9aec0ea7a8d8361fdb1c273790e20e30d5e6b1d7680ac1c6c63436bd71300fac","provider_session_id":"64271fd0-6210-434e-be6c-3eb86ef6e08c","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}